<!--
  TEST_SHIP_MAX: the realistic worst case for the HUD (default player ship of the `--device` phone preview).
  Vanilla limits (rules/store.md, ShipManager::CanFitSystem / CanFitSubsystem): fewer than 8 reactor-powered
  systems to buy another -> at most 8 main systems; fewer than 4 subsystems -> at most 4 (pilot, sensors, doors,
  battery). Main systems chosen: shields, engines, oxygen, weapons, drones, cloaking, hacking, mind control (no
  medbay / teleporter / artillery: they would exceed 8). Every system at its blueprint maxPower; reactor 25
  (vanilla cap), 4 weapon slots, 3 drone slots, 8 crew (vanilla maximum). Same fed_cruiser rooms as TEST_SHIP_ALL.
-->
<shipBlueprint name="TEST_SHIP_MAX" layout="fed_cruiser" img="fed_cruiser">
